== Effect ==
* Pulls all types of [[coin]]s towards Isaac. Ignores all other [[pickup]]s.
** Also affects the vanishing coins of {{c|Tainted Keeper}}.

== Synergies ==
* {{A|Golden Trinket}} / {{i|Mom's Box|r}}: Additionally pulls in {{e|Key}}s and {{e|Bomb}}s. [[Heart]]s are also pulled if Isaac can pick them up.
** While playing as {{C|Tainted ???}}, poop pickups won't be attracted.

